== report
change: Add tagOwners for tag:ovenlight-app-coach, tag:ovenlight-guest-coach (owner autogroup:admin).
change: Narrow acls rule 1 from everything reaching everything to autogroup:member reaching autogroup:member, so guest devices neither inherit it nor see your devices.
change: Add one rule to grants: alex@example.com may reach tag:ovenlight-app-coach on ports 443 and 8443, as a tagged node is no longer one of your own devices.
change: Add one rule to grants: tag:ovenlight-guest-coach may reach only tag:ovenlight-app-coach:443.
note: "*" also covered people you share devices with from their own tailnets (autogroup:shared); they aren't in autogroup:member. If you share devices that way, add their access back explicitly.
